{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Unravel the Secrets of Shimagami</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a post-apocalyptic world where men have vanished, only demi-human women remain to save world from creatures. The land\u2019s inhabitants worship a mysterious deity known as Shimagami.But what secrets lie hidden beneath this divine figure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shimagami is an open-world action RPG with fast-paced combat, vibrant anime-style visuals, and deep lore. Explore a vast and mysterious world, battle formidable creatures, solve intricate puzzles, and complete challenging trials to uncover the truth behind Shimagami\u2019s legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each warrior you meet is a unique demi-human heroine\u2014ranging from fierce dragon-girls to cunning cat-girls and powerful demon-girls. Every character wields a completely different weapon, with distinct combat styles, animations, and abilities. Master their skills, adapt to different battle scenarios, and forge your own path through the ruins of a forgotten civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With regular updates introducing new characters and story expansions, the journey never ends. Are you ready to uncover the truth behind Shimagami?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574160?t=1742370038","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574160/ef9e7250164935cb35e01e37c7f25ac5a4297905/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742370038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574160/ef81026a710fc7fd54494a2e16c172c51d145720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742370038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574160/ef81026a710fc7fd54494a2e16c172c51d145720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742370038","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game does not contain excessive nudity or sexual content. However, some outfits and costumes may be considered too revealing by some players."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Unravel the Secrets of Shimagami</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a post-apocalyptic world where men have vanished, only demi-human women remain to save world from creatures. The land\u2019s inhabitants worship a mysterious deity known as Shimagami.But what secrets lie hidden beneath this divine figure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shimagami is an open-world action RPG with fast-paced combat, vibrant anime-style visuals, and deep lore. Explore a vast and mysterious world, battle formidable creatures, solve intricate puzzles, and complete challenging trials to uncover the truth behind Shimagami\u2019s legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each warrior you meet is a unique demi-human heroine\u2014ranging from fierce dragon-girls to cunning cat-girls and powerful demon-girls. Every character wields a completely different weapon, with distinct combat styles, animations, and abilities. Master their skills, adapt to different battle scenarios, and forge your own path through the ruins of a forgotten civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With regular updates introducing new characters and story expansions, the journey never ends. Are you ready to uncover the truth behind Shimagami?</p>","developers":["Danteon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574160/40b774eb4b5788b7ebe49f531aca5b08414c123d/header.jpg?t=1742370038","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight"